## Modifications

The following modifications were made to adapt these plugins for VSCode:
1. Rewrote core formatting engine in Rust (via napi-rs native module)
2. Created extension.js to integrate with VSCode formatting API
3. Removed Sublime Text specific dependencies
4. Added configuration support through VSCode settings
5. Added CLI binary (svtools) for standalone formatting

