Native waveform components

The native module uses wellen 0.25.7 and fst-reader 0.17.1 for waveform
reading, and wavefst 0.4.0 for VCD to FST conversion. The copyright notices
and license terms for these components and their added Windows runtime
dependencies are in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

-----------------------------------------------------------------------
PyWellen MCP

SV Tools draws on the design of PyWellen MCP's signal_get_statistics,
debug_build_timeline, format_as_signed, and export_to_csv tools. These
features are adapted to the SV Tools Rust waveform engine and JavaScript
CLI, with SV Tools windowing, pagination, and export behavior.

Upstream project: https://github.com/fvutils/pywellen-mcp
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy is included in the
root LICENSE file (LICENSE.txt in the binary archives).
